te. Listing the first few elements of our set, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{(0)}(x) & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\ {h}^{(1)}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)=3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\ {h}^{(2)}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)=-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\ {h}^{(3)}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)=-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\ {h}^{(4)}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)=3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\ ⋮\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, $C$ contains four elements:\n\n$$\nC={3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x,3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x,-3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}\n$$\n\nConsequently, $|C|=4,$ which is finite.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$A$ and $B$ only.\"" 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306576 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306577 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306578 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306579 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306580 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1041 "selection" 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1104 #edb/ref 17592186306578 13194139534736 true] [17592186306575 1110 #uuid "2c416890-3119-58f7-b29c-864579a74654" 13194139534736 true] [17592186306576 1034 "$A$ and $C$ only" 13194139534736 true] [17592186306576 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534736 true] [17592186306576 1111 #uuid "fe0509d2-ffb4-5eb7-8db6-084b21c12b93" 13194139534736 true] [17592186306577 1034 "$B$ and $C$ only" 13194139534736 true] [17592186306577 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534736 true] [17592186306577 1111 #uuid "443e8ac6-8d34-5ad0-afb1-f4ae3bfd624c" 13194139534736 true] [17592186306578 1034 "$A$ and $B$ only" 13194139534736 true] [17592186306578 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534736 true] [17592186306578 1111